    "tr": "Mighty Hero, good at striking enemies individually and in unit formation. Can learn |cffffc800Rend|r, |cffffc800Warmarch Aura|r, |cffffc800Battle Shout|r and |cffffc800Ravager|r.\nAdditionally has |cffffc800Ensnare |rability.\n\nAttacks land units."
